{{Quote|text=}}
'''Marlon''' is a seasoned monster slayer of much renown, and leader of the Stardew Valley [[Stardew:Adventurer's Guild|Adventurer's Guild]]. The guild was founded some 25 years before the farmer's arrival, after Marlon received permission from [[Setting#Order_of_the_Knights_of_Pythagoras|the Order of the Knights of Pythagoras]].

Marlon is a respected adventurer, not only in [[Pelican Town]], but to other guilds as well. He has strong relations with [[Gil]] and [[Magnus]], as well as adventurers from the [[Castle Village]] guild, including [[Camilla]], [[Alesia]] and [[Isaac]]. He is also good friends with [[Stardew:Krobus|Krobus]], whom he hid in [[Stardew:The Sewer|The Sewer]] for protection from other adventurers who might wish him harm.

For canon information on Marlon, please refer to the [[Stardew:Marlon|Stardew Valley Wiki - Marlon]] page.

